x":456,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":98},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-068bc9d40974f88b77f9","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-068bc9d40974f88b77f9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：嘉平三年（公元 251）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-563b7a630850bbcc0541","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"shaodi-q-o048","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-214613f5a625f33a352f","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月〖1〗，荆州刺史王基、新城太守（陈）〔州〕泰攻吴〖2〗。破之，降者数千口。二月，置南郡之夷陵县以居降附〖3〗。三月，以尚书令司马孚为司空〖4〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":206,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":77},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o162b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-671499ac1e4476e8a616","layer":"original","quote":"初，临海罗阳县有神〖2〗，自称王表；﹝一﹞周旋民间，语言饮食，与人无异，然不见其形。又有一婢，名纺绩。是月，遣中书郎李崇，赍辅国将军、罗阳王印绶，迎表〖3〗。表随崇俱出，与崇及所在郡守、令长谈论，崇等无以易〖4〗。所历山川，辄遣婢与其神相闻。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":298,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":23,"end":144},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o163a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-c1883440539f9e6e457b","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，崇与表至；权于苍龙门外为立第舍〖5〗，数使近臣赍酒食往。表说水旱小事，往往有验。﹝二﹞","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":299,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o162","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-671499ac1e4476e8a616","layer":"original","quote":"太元元年夏五月，立皇后潘氏〖1〗。大赦，改年。初，临海罗阳县有神〖2〗，自称王表；﹝一﹞周旋民间，语言饮食，与人无异，然不见其形。又有一婢，名纺绩。是月，遣中书郎李崇，赍辅国将军、罗阳王印绶，迎表〖3〗。表随崇俱出，与崇及所在郡守、令长谈论，崇等无以易〖4〗。所历山川，辄遣婢与其神相闻。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":298,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":144},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o163","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-c1883440539f9e6e457b","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，崇与表至；权于苍龙门外为立第舍〖5〗，数使近臣赍酒食往。表说水旱小事，往往有验。﹝二﹞","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":299,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47},{"id":"wuzhu-q-p072-judgment","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-268ed3534c5cf830a482","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞孙盛曰：“盛闻国将兴，听于民；国将亡，听于神。权年老志衰，谗臣在侧；废嫡立庶，以妾为妻：可谓多凉德矣。而伪设符命，求福妖邪；将亡之兆，不亦显乎！”","attribution":"孙盛论","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":325,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-51280e2cac3f9883b95f","start":0,"end":76}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
